      "section": "neurotic-hubsettings",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Solicitação de predefinição salva. A DLL DLSS ou Ray Reconstruction instalada determina as predefinições suportadas; Automático retém o padrão existente/herança global."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saved request only. Zero disables the override. Ratios depend on the running game, graphics card and provider qualification.",
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saved_request_only_zero_disables_the_override_ra_a66f0429",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "neurotic-hubsettings",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Apenas solicitação salva. Zero desativa a substituição. As proporções dependem do jogo em execução, placa de vídeo e qualificação do provedor."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saved resource-state override. Runtime support depends on the active non-DLSS upscaler and graphics API.",
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saved_resource_state_override_runtime_support_de_2d44221b",
      "line_breaks": true,
