      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "a cena clareia; alguns guardam seu recíproco, e um buffer"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The selected route is below the native target. Compare the measured alternatives; untested routes are unmeasured.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_selected_route_is_below_the_native_target_co_36091308",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "A rota selecionada está abaixo do alvo nativo. Compare as alternativas medidas; as rotas não testadas não foram medidas."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "the shared value and rebuilds changed models; disabling Multipass restores the",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_shared_value_and_rebuilds_changed_models_dis_a6df80bb",
      "line_breaks": false,
