      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Este jogo não fornece exposição -- o branco do papel está em uso. Tente"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "warning",
      "english": "This game supplies no exposure -- paper white is in use. Try the scan instead.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_game_supplies_no_exposure_paper_white_is_in_f21bc91d",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Este jogo não fornece exposição -- o branco do papel está em uso. Tente a varredura em vez disso."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "This is not a fudge factor. If a game needs the trim far from 1 to look",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_is_not_a_fudge_factor_if_a_game_needs_the_t_a3f41f06",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Isso não é um fator de distorção. Se um jogo precisa do trim longe de 1 para ficar"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "This was once a multiplier on a measured white point. The measurement is",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_was_once_a_multiplier_on_a_measured_white_p_6aa78244",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "No passado, era um multiplicador sobre um ponto branco medido. A medição"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "to come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.to_come_back_and_adjust_that_point_click_it_agai_f1d73a12",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "para voltar e ajustar esse ponto; clique novamente para soltá-lo."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "to control the live point. > is the point in use now.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.to_control_the_live_point_is_the_point_in_use_no_125b1b49",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "para controlar o ponto ao vivo. > é o ponto em uso no momento."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "toggled and remembered.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.toggled_and_remembered_08c3ea7e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "alternados e lembrados."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Too low and almost every pixel trips the soft knee: the model is shown a",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.too_low_and_almost_every_pixel_trips_the_soft_kn_1bba4dd3",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Muito baixo e quase todos os pixels ativam o soft knee: o modelo recebe uma"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Totals include Pass 1. 230%% means 100%% + 100%% + 30%%. Remaining settings inherit NR Settings.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.totals_include_pass_1_230_means_100_100_30_remai_eb91f51a",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
