    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Value of 0.0f can improve temporal stability of bright pixels\nLower values are more stable with ghosting\nHigher values are more pixelly, but less ghosting",
